<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <title><%= title %></title>

    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />

  </head>


  <body>
    
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    
    <main class="container mt-5 mb-5">

      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9 text-center">

          <h1>Hi, I'm Umair Siddiqui.</h1>

          <h4 class="mt-3 mb-4">
            Networking and IT Security Student
          </h4>

          <p>
            I'm currently in my second year at Ontario Tech
            University studying Networking and IT Security.
            I've always been interested in computers and
            wanted to learn more about how networks work
            and how they are protected.
          </p>

          <p>
            So far, I've worked on different projects through
            my courses, including network design and programming.
            I also work on my own websites outside of school.
            I made this portfolio to show some of the projects
            I've completed and what I've learned from them.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-4 mb-5">

            <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-primary me-2">
              My Projects
            </a>

            <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline-light">
              About Me
            </a>

          </div>

          <article class="mt-4">

            <h3>Some of My Work</h3>

            <p class="mt-3">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired me-2"></i>
              Designing networks using Cisco Packet Tracer
            </p>

            <p>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-code me-2"></i>
              Investra, my personal finance tracking website
            </p>

            <p>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code me-2"></i>
              Programming and web development assignments
            </p>

            <p>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass me-2"></i>
              SEO and website improvements for small businesses
            </p>

          </article>

        </div>
      </div>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </body>


</html>
